--   Lean source theorem: cubic_powerBasis_square_parameter
-- statement:
--   In a nontrivial commutative rational algebra with a three-dimensional power basis generated by α satisfying α³=α−η, if α²−1 is a square, there is a nonzero rational W satisfying (W²+1)²=8ηW³ or (W²+1)²=8ηW.
